WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:01.039
My name's Gary Eckert,

2
00:00:01.839 --> 00:00:05.679
and I've done business here at Phil's, and they're a real nice

3
00:00:05.739 --> 00:00:07.699
bunch of people, and they take care of you.

4
00:00:08.319 --> 00:00:11.739
I noticed that you brought donuts and coffee in. Why is that?

5
00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:15.839
The reason is these people are very nice. They treat you like you're family here.

6
00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:18.279
So you just decided to bring this in?

7
00:00:18.719 --> 00:00:21.639
I decided to bring this in as a little thank-you note.

8
00:00:21.699 --> 00:00:23.059
All right. That's pretty awesome.

9
00:00:23.559 --> 00:00:25.939
So how did you come to experience Phil's?

10
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.940
Well, I had an old grandma run into my old truck, and on the day it happened,

11
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.099
I pulled into Phil's here, and they said, "We'll get you fixed up."

12
00:00:34.279 --> 00:00:36.459
It took a little bit of time because my truck's old.

13
00:00:36.479 --> 00:00:39.739
It's an old 1993 F-250,

14
00:00:40.379 --> 00:00:43.479
so I had to get some parts, and that took a little bit of time.

15
00:00:44.099 --> 00:00:46.119
All in all, the experience was great.

16
00:00:46.459 --> 00:00:50.219
It's a good bunch of people here, a bunch of people that care about making sure

17
00:00:50.279 --> 00:00:53.659
you're satisfied with the quality of work that they've done.
